          "description": "* WHAT...An increased risk for sneaker waves and strong rip\ncurrents.\n\n* WHERE...San Francisco, Northern Monterey Bay and Southern\nMonterey Bay and Big Sur Coast Counties.\n\n* WHEN...From 5 AM PST Monday through Tuesday evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Waves can sweep across the shoreline without\nwarning, pulling people into the sea from beaches, jetties,\nand rocks.",
